# Knot Quite There (crystalWar 27): a level 99 Warrior in Windurst Waters [S] with a 108-Knot Quipu, The Tigress Strikes
# completed, the WotG mission Back to the Beginning completed and The Queen of the Dance current (GMs: past Cait Sith,
# whose own Southern San d'Oria [S] zone-in is in #caitsith; the four later-expansion missions as group 1's flows). The
# Acolyte Hostel door (script: DOOR_ACOLYTE_HOSTEL_LOCKED): 151, finished: begun; 152 (an Event: it alternates with the
# script), the script's message then 152 (the message does not count as "did something"), 152 again. Sauromugue Champaign [S]: Bulwark Gate (empty script, default DOOR_FIRMLY_SEALED):
# Prog 0: 105, finished: Prog 1; 107; the quipu: 106, finished: the trade confirmed, Prog 2; 108. East Ronfaure [S],
# then Southern San d'Oria [S]: the zone-in from East Ronfaure [S] at Prog 2: 62 (left open), finished: Prog 3. _6eo
# (empty script, default GATE_IS_LOCKED): 63, finished: completed (a Platinum Beastcoin). Completed (no section): _6eo:
# its default; the door: its script.
lists WindurstWatersS/Door_Acolyte_Hostel_down/onTrigger WindurstWatersS/onEventFinish/151 SauromugueChampaignS/Bulwark_Gate/onTrigger SauromugueChampaignS/Bulwark_Gate/onTrade SauromugueChampaignS/onEventFinish/105 SauromugueChampaignS/onEventFinish/106 SouthernSanDoriaS/_6eo/onTrigger SouthernSanDoriaS/onZoneIn/1 SouthernSanDoriaS/onEventFinish/62 SouthernSanDoriaS/onEventFinish/63
char zone=WindurstWatersS pos=125.5,-3,222.215 job=WAR lvl=99
item OneHundredEightKnotQuipu
quest CrystalWar.TheTigressStrikes completed
mission Wotg BackToTheBeginning completed
mission Wotg TheQueenOfTheDance current
mission Asa BurgeoningDread current
mission Acp ACrystallineProphecyFin current
mission Rov ARhapsodyForTheAges current
mission Soa Abomination current
login
